   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Quality Infrastructure Needs Assessment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Quality Infrastructure Needs Assessment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida g&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rdjupad beredning av ett regionalt projekt avseende        &quot;Quality Infrastructre&quot; f&#xf6;r l&#xe4;nderna p&#xe5; V&#xe4;stra Balkan. Det har PLUS   nummer: 55020273.                                                      En oberoende expert ska g&#xf6;ra en analys av aktuella behov samt        &quot;lessons learnt&quot; av tidigare projekt s&#xe5;som input till arbetet med att utforma projektet. Det blir en ny insats i PLUS, just den h&#xe4;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida is doing an appraisal of a regional project regarding &quot;Quality   Infrastructre&quot; for the countries of the Western Balkans (see PLUS     55020273).                                                             We want an independent expert to do an analysis current needs and    lessons learnt from a previous project, as an input to the work to    design the project.</narrative>
  </description>
